WEBVTT

02:56.800 --> 02:58.240
The Shu road is steep,

02:58.320 --> 03:00.480
harder than climbing green mountains.

03:00.560 --> 03:01.600
Cut it out.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.840
You're reading it wrong.

03:08.600 --> 03:10.000
You scared me to death.

03:10.080 --> 03:11.760
I thought my mom suddenly came back.

03:12.840 --> 03:14.400
Officer Ran, what is it?

03:15.600 --> 03:17.360
GAOKAO SECRETS
HIGH SCHOOL CHINESE FULL REVIEW GUIDE

03:19.000 --> 03:19.840
Du Mingliang.

03:19.920 --> 03:22.120
Someone saw you hanging
around the building all day,

03:22.200 --> 03:23.160
acting suspicious.

03:23.240 --> 03:25.280
They think you've been
stealing women's underwear,

03:25.360 --> 03:27.560
stockings, and high heels.

03:27.640 --> 03:28.840
Who's spreading that nonsense?

03:29.640 --> 03:32.120
Officer Ran, I'm not some fetishist.

03:32.200 --> 03:33.560
My mom's going through menopause.

03:33.640 --> 03:35.080
She keeps nagging me about gaming,

03:35.160 --> 03:36.680
so now I spend my days

03:36.760 --> 03:37.920
playing cat and mouse
with her in the hallway.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.640
Do you remember?

03:39.720 --> 03:42.040
Back then, you even mistook me
for a Pattia hostess.

03:51.160 --> 03:52.920
I swear on everything I own,

03:53.000 --> 03:55.360
I'm absolutely not a pervert.

03:55.960 --> 03:57.360
Then who do you think it is?

04:02.400 --> 04:03.520
Du Mingliang.

04:10.080 --> 04:12.480
Du Mingliang. You've got some nerve.

04:12.560 --> 04:15.400
You played games until you ranked
dead last in school,

04:15.480 --> 04:18.519
and now you've even brought
the police right to the door.

04:18.600 --> 04:20.000
You really think
I won't beat you senseless?

04:20.079 --> 04:20.760
-Please…
-Beat you senseless?

04:20.839 --> 04:23.000
-Mrs. Du, it's a misunderstanding.
-Officer Ran,

04:23.080 --> 04:26.120
did he do something wrong?

04:26.200 --> 04:28.920
It's a misunderstanding.
I'm just here to ask Du a few questions.

04:34.840 --> 04:36.280
About what?

04:36.880 --> 04:37.800
It's about…

04:38.400 --> 04:39.640
The severed head case?

04:46.600 --> 04:47.840
Let me tell you,

04:47.920 --> 04:49.160
years ago,

04:49.240 --> 04:50.560
I did see Xu Zhihong.

04:51.520 --> 04:52.800
When?

04:54.160 --> 04:55.800
It should've been

04:55.880 --> 04:57.320
before the Hong Kong handover.

04:57.400 --> 05:01.280
Back then, Xu Zhihong ran to 1713,

05:01.360 --> 05:04.080
Qihuang Clinic,
to argue with Zhang Ersong.

05:04.160 --> 05:07.000
I just happened to pass by and heard

05:07.520 --> 05:10.240
him shouting inside
about exposing something.

05:12.720 --> 05:14.280
This Zhang Ersong

05:14.360 --> 05:15.960
is Master Zhang from Qihuang Clinic.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.680
What Master Zhang?

05:18.360 --> 05:20.840
He's nothing but a con artist
who's done time.

05:20.920 --> 05:23.200
I'm from Langzhong, same as him.

05:23.800 --> 05:26.000
So Qihuang Clinic was shut down

05:26.080 --> 05:27.840
because Xu Zhihong exposed him?

05:27.920 --> 05:28.760
Shut down? Not at all.

05:28.840 --> 05:31.280
They just moved
to a bigger place to expand.

05:31.360 --> 05:33.360
Now it's a large clinic.

05:33.440 --> 05:34.920
What's it called?

05:35.000 --> 05:36.400
Songbentang.

05:40.560 --> 05:42.960
I've lived here for over 20 years.

05:43.040 --> 05:46.600
Back when Xu's mother was still alive,
we had some contact.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.720
Ever since Xu died in a mountain accident,

05:48.800 --> 05:50.880
he started borrowing money everywhere.

05:50.960 --> 05:52.520
I didn't dare keep in touch
with them anymore.

05:54.200 --> 05:55.400
Can you think back again,

05:56.000 --> 05:57.640
before the 1997 handover of Hong Kong,

05:57.720 --> 06:00.680
did anything unusual
happen in the Xu family?

06:01.720 --> 06:03.000
Unusual?

06:04.080 --> 06:05.880
Unusual…

06:07.680 --> 06:08.520
Yes, there was something unusual.

06:09.120 --> 06:12.840
It was a few days
before Hong Kong's handover.

06:33.760 --> 06:36.480
POWER OUTAGE NOTICE

06:44.560 --> 06:45.600
What's wrong, Uncle Wang?

06:46.480 --> 06:47.520
Xu,

06:48.040 --> 06:49.680
why is your place
making that banging noise?

06:51.360 --> 06:53.840
My dad wants to sell the big wardrobe.

06:53.920 --> 06:56.120
The doorway's too narrow.
Can't get it out.

06:56.200 --> 06:59.200
So I thought I'd chisel
the doorframe a bit.

06:59.280 --> 07:01.360
Why sell it?

07:02.600 --> 07:05.280
There's a qigong master in Yuanlongli

07:05.360 --> 07:06.880
who claims he can cure anything.

07:06.960 --> 07:08.240
He's just expensive.

07:08.320 --> 07:09.640
Oh…

07:10.600 --> 07:12.040
Uncle Wang,

07:12.120 --> 07:13.760
you…

07:13.840 --> 07:16.120
I've got mung bean soup cooking at home.

07:16.200 --> 07:17.320
It's going to burn.

07:17.400 --> 07:18.520
It's going to burn.

07:19.720 --> 07:20.600
It's burning…

07:32.680 --> 07:33.800
30TH MONDAY

07:36.640 --> 07:39.200
That wardrobe was still inside, not sold.

07:39.280 --> 07:42.200
The scrap collector came the next day

07:42.280 --> 07:44.680
and haggled with Xu for a long time.

07:44.760 --> 07:47.480
In the end, they didn't
reach a deal on the wardrobe,

07:47.560 --> 07:50.040
so he just took away
a bunch of jars and bottles.

07:54.880 --> 07:56.160
How about this?

07:56.840 --> 07:59.200
Call the person who hired you

07:59.880 --> 08:02.920
and tell him the 500 is up.

08:03.000 --> 08:04.320
Ask him to send you more.

08:06.520 --> 08:07.760
Do you have the number?

08:08.280 --> 08:09.200
Let me check.

08:12.120 --> 08:13.280
Still here.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.920
This one.

08:17.360 --> 08:18.600
A Guangdong number?

08:23.480 --> 08:25.400
I haven't called it in years.

08:27.480 --> 08:30.360
Hello. The number you have dialed
is no longer in service.

08:30.440 --> 08:32.640
Please check and dial again.

08:32.720 --> 08:34.640
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed…

08:34.720 --> 08:36.400
Please check and dial again.

08:37.520 --> 08:40.440
Hello. The number you have dialed
is no longer in service.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.200
Please check and dial again.

08:49.880 --> 08:52.960
Hello. The number you have dialed
is no longer in service.

08:53.040 --> 08:54.880
Please check and dial again.

08:56.720 --> 08:59.040
How did it become a dead number?

09:00.160 --> 09:02.600
Even this last bit of hope is gone.

09:04.880 --> 09:06.240
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

09:08.040 --> 09:10.920
Freedom, freedom

09:11.520 --> 09:14.720
Close your eyes
And get a good night's sleep

09:14.800 --> 09:17.760
Run, run
Leave the past behind

09:18.360 --> 09:21.200
No matter the outcome, it doesn't matter

09:27.000 --> 09:28.000
Why did it stop?

09:44.920 --> 09:47.120
Who let you sneak the instruments out?

09:49.120 --> 09:50.160
Dad,

09:50.760 --> 09:52.280
we just borrowed them for a bit.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.000
We'll take good care of them.

09:54.080 --> 09:54.760
SLOW

09:54.840 --> 09:55.840
Nothing will get damaged.

09:56.600 --> 09:57.520
What did I tell you?

09:58.320 --> 09:59.480
If you want to start a band,

09:59.560 --> 10:01.560
bring me a university
admission letter in exchange.

10:01.640 --> 10:03.320
Did you take that as nothing?

10:03.840 --> 10:05.320
Move everything back!

10:12.080 --> 10:13.400
I'll deal with you when you get home.

10:15.520 --> 10:16.560
Uncle.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.400
We've written a new song.

10:21.160 --> 10:22.160
Do you want to hear it?

10:22.760 --> 10:24.480
Maybe after you listen,

10:25.000 --> 10:26.720
you'll support our rock dream.

10:31.080 --> 10:32.960
Rock dream?

10:36.320 --> 10:37.440
Is that something
students should be doing?

10:39.160 --> 10:40.080
Look at you all,

10:40.160 --> 10:42.800
one worse than the next,
acting like hooligans.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.480
Instead of studying properly at home,

10:44.560 --> 10:45.680
you mess around all day.

10:45.760 --> 10:46.920
What future will you have?

10:49.520 --> 10:50.440
Are you moving it or not?

10:54.400 --> 10:55.800
Not moving it, right?

10:57.480 --> 10:58.240
Dad.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.720
-Let go.
-Don't grab it.

10:59.800 --> 11:01.560
-Let go.
-Don't grab it.

11:03.240 --> 11:04.200
Keyboard!

11:11.320 --> 11:14.080
PUBLIC SECURITY

11:14.160 --> 11:16.520
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

11:17.520 --> 11:20.320
Captain, before Han Zi'ang
injured someone,

11:20.400 --> 11:22.320
he was very likely attacked.

11:22.920 --> 11:24.880
Explain. How did you come
to that conclusion?

11:24.960 --> 11:27.360
When I went to Yuanlongli to investigate,

11:28.240 --> 11:29.400
I ran into my dad.

11:30.080 --> 11:30.920
He and Ran

11:33.760 --> 11:36.120
once carried out an immersive reenactment.

11:38.920 --> 11:41.280
I know my dad wasn't in the clearest
state of mind back then,

11:41.360 --> 11:43.960
but I believe Captain Ran's theory
is sound.

11:44.040 --> 11:45.400
The Han Zi'ang case

11:45.920 --> 11:47.560
is definitely more than just a prank.

11:48.960 --> 11:50.240
MODERN LAW ENFORCEMENT
UNWAVERING POLICE EXCELLENCE

11:52.080 --> 11:54.880
Yesterday, I also
made a pledge to the principal.

11:54.960 --> 11:55.920
Within a week,

11:56.000 --> 11:58.840
I'll prove that Han Zi'ang acted
in self defense.

11:58.920 --> 12:01.480
Otherwise, he'll be expelled.

12:02.000 --> 12:05.120
Captain, can you assign me more manpower?

12:10.600 --> 12:11.880
Xiaohe,

12:11.960 --> 12:15.000
I understand how you feel.

12:15.080 --> 12:16.200
You want to find the truth

12:16.280 --> 12:17.760
and help Han Zi'ang.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.880
But the situation in the unit,
you should know it too.

12:19.960 --> 12:22.000
Those four kids still haven't been found.

12:22.520 --> 12:25.680
Everyone… Right now, everyone
is tied up with the task force.

12:25.760 --> 12:27.560
You're relying on Mr. He and Ran…

12:29.200 --> 12:31.160
Just on a few of Mr. He's deductions,

12:31.240 --> 12:33.280
with no evidence, no leads.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.760
Then tell me,

12:34.840 --> 12:36.400
how am I supposed to ask
the task force for people?

12:54.960 --> 12:56.840
FREE REFILLS, HELP YOURSELF

13:02.560 --> 13:03.400
Why the long face?

13:07.200 --> 13:08.960
Is the cafeteria food that bad?

13:10.600 --> 13:12.520
It's not bad,

13:12.600 --> 13:13.800
it just feels awful.

13:16.680 --> 13:17.680
The Han Zi'ang case?

13:21.240 --> 13:22.520
I don't have a single lead right now.

13:22.600 --> 13:24.760
And my dad keeps making things worse.

13:24.840 --> 13:26.840
This is my first case.

13:27.840 --> 13:29.400
If only Uncle Ran were here,

13:30.040 --> 13:32.120
he'd never let me turn in a blank.

13:32.200 --> 13:34.160
In the whole Nanshan Branch,

13:34.240 --> 13:37.040
people who say that
could line up to the gate.

13:38.400 --> 13:41.040
When you handle cases,
if all you do is rely on Captain Ran,

13:41.760 --> 13:42.960
then do you know,

13:43.040 --> 13:44.880
back then, Captain Ran
also had someone he relied on?

13:44.960 --> 13:46.000
Who?

13:46.520 --> 13:48.080
Someone even more impressive
than Uncle Ran?

13:48.800 --> 13:51.200
One time after working late,
I went for a late-night snack

13:51.720 --> 13:53.360
and ran into your Uncle Ran
at the entrance.

13:53.440 --> 13:55.360
He seemed troubled.

13:56.120 --> 13:58.520
That was the first time I saw him drink.

14:00.160 --> 14:01.440
He told me

14:02.040 --> 14:04.240
the person he respected most
from the bottom of his heart

14:05.800 --> 14:07.120
was your dad.

14:09.160 --> 14:11.520
He also said, if not for your dad,

14:11.600 --> 14:14.040
he wouldn't have made it
this far so smoothly.

14:14.120 --> 14:16.160
He might not have even gotten through
his very first case.

14:18.120 --> 14:19.600
When did that happen?

14:21.160 --> 14:22.680
Around 2002, I think.

14:26.200 --> 14:27.400
Time flies.

14:30.480 --> 14:32.320
It's been 12 years
since Captain Ran passed.

14:37.680 --> 14:39.640
If you want to look
into Han Zi'ang's case,

14:40.160 --> 14:41.760
you'd better ask
the experts from Yuanlongli.

14:42.560 --> 14:43.840
There are two experts in the unit.

14:44.440 --> 14:45.960
One was Captain Ran back then,

14:46.480 --> 14:48.200
and the other is your dad.

15:30.640 --> 15:31.800
NOTEBOOK

15:35.760 --> 15:38.720
SITUATION AT THE 18TH FLOOR

15:54.320 --> 15:56.560
FLOOR PLAN OF YUANLONGLI
UNDERGROUND PARKING GARAGE

16:00.600 --> 16:02.840
How did I forget
about the underground garage?

16:21.200 --> 16:24.720
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

16:24.800 --> 16:27.320
CLOSED

16:45.240 --> 16:47.280
NEW YORK BLOCK

16:47.360 --> 16:49.880
Miss, take a look,
we've got new flowers in.

16:50.400 --> 16:52.200
-No thanks. Thank you.
-It's alright.

17:00.560 --> 17:03.280
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

17:03.920 --> 17:06.000
-No, I haven't.
-Thank you.

17:07.079 --> 17:08.599
Sir, hello.

17:08.680 --> 17:10.760
Have you seen this child before?

17:11.280 --> 17:13.839
BARBECUE AND BAR

17:13.920 --> 17:16.760
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

17:16.839 --> 17:17.599
Have you seen him?

17:17.680 --> 17:19.720
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

17:19.800 --> 17:20.839
Have you seen this child?

17:20.920 --> 17:22.000
I haven't seen him.

17:22.079 --> 17:24.400
Have you seen this child before?

17:24.480 --> 17:25.760
Have you seen him?

17:26.280 --> 17:27.359
Have you seen this child?

17:27.440 --> 17:30.320
Hello. Have you seen this child before?

17:30.400 --> 17:31.440
No, I haven't.

17:32.920 --> 17:33.920
Thank you.

17:34.680 --> 17:36.040
JUAN JUAN SHOE SHOP

17:36.120 --> 17:42.960
FREE NAIL ART AND TATTOO TRAINING

17:47.080 --> 17:50.200
The Tremaux method
is the most time consuming

17:50.280 --> 17:53.160
among all maze solving methods,
but it has the highest success rate.

17:53.240 --> 17:56.680
The idea is to walk through every path

17:56.760 --> 17:59.120
and mark them to avoid repeating mistakes.

17:59.200 --> 18:01.520
LIANGLIANG COMPUTER SUPPLIES

18:01.600 --> 18:02.920
Hello, boss.

18:03.000 --> 18:05.240
May I ask, how do I get
to the stairway to New York Block?

18:05.840 --> 18:08.320
Left, right, right,
left, left, left, right.

18:10.320 --> 18:11.920
-Thanks.
-Yeah.

18:14.880 --> 18:16.960
Recently, have you seen this student?

18:17.040 --> 18:17.880
What for?

18:21.360 --> 18:22.240
Police investigation.

18:27.160 --> 18:28.080
Haven't seen him.

18:30.320 --> 18:31.360
Thanks.

19:07.240 --> 19:08.120
Xiaohe,

19:09.160 --> 19:10.680
why are you sitting here alone?

19:10.760 --> 19:12.000
Where is everyone else?

19:20.360 --> 19:21.360
What's wrong?

19:21.960 --> 19:23.160
Rehearsal not going well?

19:38.040 --> 19:40.800
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

20:03.680 --> 20:05.640
Did something happen?

20:06.240 --> 20:08.000
It's not me. It's the keyboard player.

20:08.600 --> 20:09.800
His dad came today,

20:09.880 --> 20:11.920
took all the instruments, and beat him up.

20:13.720 --> 20:15.440
Why are adults always like this?

20:15.520 --> 20:17.120
Why can't they support our dreams?

20:17.200 --> 20:18.880
Didn't they have dreams
when they were young?

20:26.160 --> 20:28.760
Maybe when they chased their dreams,

20:28.840 --> 20:30.400
they stumbled too many times,

20:30.480 --> 20:32.800
so they don't want you
to go through the same thing.

20:33.400 --> 20:35.520
Whether his dad has dreams, I don't know,

20:35.600 --> 20:37.560
but my dad definitely doesn't have any.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.840
Otherwise, my mom wouldn't
have gotten so mad, she left home.

20:53.200 --> 20:58.160
BANK

21:32.000 --> 21:34.040
CONTACT: YUN, MAKE A CALL?

21:36.480 --> 21:37.320
CONTACT: YUN

21:37.400 --> 21:41.240
CALLING YUN

21:41.320 --> 21:42.160
END CALL

22:33.040 --> 22:35.280
-What are you doing?
-Noise. Disturbing the peace.

22:35.880 --> 22:37.760
Leave my room immediately.

22:37.840 --> 22:38.880
He.

22:45.520 --> 22:47.160
Look at her,
acting completely out of control.

22:47.240 --> 22:48.720
Take it easy.

22:49.240 --> 22:50.360
Leave it to me.

23:16.880 --> 23:18.760
How did you do that?
What did you say to her?

23:19.440 --> 23:21.120
Nothing much.
Just gave her a pair of headphones.

23:24.160 --> 23:25.000
Eat first.

23:25.760 --> 23:27.040
There's more in the pot
if it's not enough.

23:33.240 --> 23:35.080
Let's talk business.
I'll brief you on the case.

23:36.000 --> 23:37.440
The Forensic Department

23:37.520 --> 23:40.400
found signs of arsenic poisoning
in Xu Zhihong's skull.

23:41.040 --> 23:42.880
At the Xu residence,

23:42.960 --> 23:44.480
I found some herbal residue.

23:45.280 --> 23:46.440
I've already handed it over to Liang Juan.

23:46.520 --> 23:49.440
The test report should be out tomorrow.

23:51.200 --> 23:52.200
Zhang…

23:55.200 --> 23:56.520
Zhang Ersong.

23:56.600 --> 23:57.560
Who?

23:59.840 --> 24:02.280
Master Zhang from 1713 Qihuang Clinic.

24:02.360 --> 24:04.760
This should be the prescription
he gave Xu Zhihong.

24:04.840 --> 24:06.760
I found out Xu Zhihong
once had a huge argument

24:06.840 --> 24:07.800
with Zhang Ersong.

24:07.880 --> 24:09.080
He even threatened to expose him.

24:09.160 --> 24:11.280
The two fell out badly.

24:11.360 --> 24:12.800
Zhang Ersong

24:13.720 --> 24:14.600
deliberately poisoned him?

24:21.240 --> 24:24.560
The skin of mung beans is green.
It belongs to wood.

24:24.640 --> 24:25.320
QIGONG MASTER, ZHANG ERSONG

24:25.840 --> 24:28.960
When boiled into soup, it turns yellow,
which belongs to earth.

24:29.040 --> 24:30.640
This spirited,

24:30.720 --> 24:32.680
energetic elderly gentleman

24:32.760 --> 24:34.600
is the renowned healer of Beijing,

24:34.680 --> 24:36.120
a third generation inheritor,

24:36.200 --> 24:38.080
Master Zhang Ersong.

24:38.160 --> 24:40.040
Mung beans and eggplant,

24:40.640 --> 24:42.400
together complete the five elements.

24:42.920 --> 24:47.200
THE MEDICINAL DREGS DELIVERED YESTERDAY
CONTAINED TRACE ARSENIC.

24:49.000 --> 24:50.800
Songbentang Traditional Medicine Clinic

24:50.880 --> 24:54.440
was founded by Master Zhang Ersong,

24:54.520 --> 24:56.720
a third generation healer of Beijing.

24:57.320 --> 24:58.600
-Master Zhang Ersong
-Zhang Ersong.

24:58.680 --> 25:00.600
is like Hua Tuo reborn.

25:00.680 --> 25:01.640
What are you here for?

25:02.160 --> 25:03.840
-Registration number?
-What number?

25:04.720 --> 25:06.520
To see Master Zhang, you need to register.

25:06.600 --> 25:08.240
This number should work, right?

25:08.320 --> 25:09.240
I don't care who you are.

25:09.320 --> 25:11.440
Even the mayor has to register.

25:11.520 --> 25:13.400
And Master Zhang is off today,
no consultations.

25:16.840 --> 25:17.960
Zhang Ersong,

25:18.040 --> 25:19.880
a relative from your hometown
in Langzhong is here.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.880
Your home is in Chentang County,

25:21.960 --> 25:23.960
Maquan Township, Wumaganzhi Village.

25:24.040 --> 25:26.400
At 25, you committed fraud
and served time.

25:26.480 --> 25:28.120
-At 28…
-Zhao,

25:28.800 --> 25:30.600
let this patient in.

25:31.120 --> 25:33.320
You can tell at a glance
he's seriously ill.

25:33.400 --> 25:34.240
Alright.

25:35.800 --> 25:37.120
Go on in.

25:41.160 --> 25:42.440
BENEVOLENT HEART, DIVINE HEALING

25:42.520 --> 25:43.760
A MIRACLE HEALER, A BENEVOLENT MASTER

25:51.160 --> 25:52.160
Please have a look, both of you.

25:53.440 --> 25:54.440
WEIYANG PEOPLE'S HOSPITAL
MEDICAL DIAGNOSIS

25:54.520 --> 25:55.440
Officers,

25:55.520 --> 25:57.520
I've truly been wronged.

25:57.600 --> 26:00.600
The prescription I gave Xu Zhihong

26:00.680 --> 26:03.120
was something I developed
through years of research.

26:03.200 --> 26:05.600
Even now that I'm ill,

26:05.680 --> 26:07.600
I'm still using the same prescription.

26:10.880 --> 26:13.320
What exactly is in
this prescription of yours?

26:13.920 --> 26:16.440
That's a trade secret.

26:16.960 --> 26:18.520
A proprietary formula.

26:19.320 --> 26:22.400
You added a large amount
of realgar to this medicine, didn't you?

26:23.000 --> 26:23.960
How do you know?

26:25.440 --> 26:27.880
Realgar contains a high amount of arsenic.

26:27.960 --> 26:29.440
Long term excessive use

26:29.520 --> 26:31.800
can lead to arsenic poisoning.

26:32.480 --> 26:33.320
You…

26:33.840 --> 26:35.480
You're not trying to fool me, are you?

26:38.200 --> 26:40.040
Hospital reports don't lie, do they?

26:40.720 --> 26:43.680
Anyone with basic scientific knowledge
would understand that.

26:45.440 --> 26:46.960
This is the first time I've seen

26:47.040 --> 26:49.080
someone poison others
and not spare himself.

26:53.720 --> 26:54.680
Tell me,

26:54.760 --> 26:57.520
that Xu Zhihong,
why did he want to expose you?

26:58.480 --> 27:01.240
That was due to his frostbite condition.

27:01.320 --> 27:03.000
How would I know?

27:03.080 --> 27:05.440
After Xu Zhihong got the medicine,

27:05.520 --> 27:06.880
he started pestering me,

27:06.960 --> 27:08.720
demanding a refund,

27:08.800 --> 27:10.560
even threatening to go to the media.

27:10.640 --> 27:12.520
You tell me,

27:12.600 --> 27:14.760
how could I not get
into a conflict with him?

27:16.160 --> 27:17.680
A conflict is one thing,

27:17.760 --> 27:20.600
but it wouldn't escalate
to the level of murder.

27:22.960 --> 27:24.000
The key is…

27:28.800 --> 27:31.600
The key is, I already refunded his money.

27:33.960 --> 27:36.040
REFUND RECEIPT

27:39.400 --> 27:41.080
Before you moved out of Yuanlongli,

27:41.160 --> 27:43.000
did you encounter anything unusual?

27:43.080 --> 27:45.120
If you're asking about the case,

27:45.200 --> 27:46.880
I really don't know.

27:46.960 --> 27:49.160
But if you want gossip,

27:49.240 --> 27:50.880
back in those days at Qihuang Clinic,

27:50.960 --> 27:52.400
there was gossip every day.

27:52.480 --> 27:54.440
The property manager, Qian Dajun,

27:54.520 --> 27:56.440
used to moonlight at my place,
reselling appointment slots.

27:56.520 --> 27:58.480
Cripple Du from the steel factory

27:58.560 --> 28:00.360
and Song Qingsong from the cement plant

28:00.440 --> 28:02.840
both came to me for kidney issues.

28:03.440 --> 28:05.720
But Song Qingsong didn't come often.

28:05.800 --> 28:07.920
The membership card he got
was used by his brother-in-law.

28:08.000 --> 28:09.920
And Jin Manshan from Jinsha Market

28:10.000 --> 28:12.480
also came to me for heart treatment.

28:15.560 --> 28:17.760
Back then, someone
came to me to practice qigong,

28:17.840 --> 28:20.920
saying he wanted to treat
his strange condition.

28:21.000 --> 28:21.960
A strange condition?

28:22.040 --> 28:24.520
He said he had a peculiar habit.

28:25.840 --> 28:27.520
He couldn't be with women,

28:27.600 --> 28:29.960
yet he liked collecting women's clothing

28:30.480 --> 28:33.560
and watching women's bodies
from a distance.

28:39.320 --> 28:40.320
Who was that person?

28:41.200 --> 28:42.240
I remember now.

28:42.320 --> 28:44.240
Xu Zhihong was introduced by him.

28:44.320 --> 28:46.320
He even said Xu Meng was his god-sister.

28:47.080 --> 28:49.920
You could tell right away
it wasn't a proper relationship.

28:50.000 --> 28:51.360
Who exactly was it?

28:51.440 --> 28:53.800
Didn't I just mention him?

28:54.400 --> 28:55.800
Wu Shanlong.

29:07.960 --> 29:08.960
Hello?

29:09.040 --> 29:10.040
Officer He,

29:10.120 --> 29:11.840
the video rental shop owner
you asked me to find

29:11.920 --> 29:12.840
has been arrested at the station.

29:17.400 --> 29:20.680
PUBLIC SECURITY

29:27.640 --> 29:28.720
I'd like to ask,

29:28.800 --> 29:31.000
for producing obscene discs,

29:31.080 --> 29:32.520
how long would I be sentenced?

29:33.120 --> 29:35.640
If I provide clues
about the severed head case,

29:36.400 --> 29:38.120
would that count as meritorious service?

29:41.080 --> 29:42.440
Wu Zhengxiong.

29:42.520 --> 29:43.600
Whether it counts as meritorious service

29:43.680 --> 29:45.120
depends on whether
the information you provide

29:45.200 --> 29:46.160
is actually useful.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.840
It'll definitely be useful.

29:48.480 --> 29:49.640
Back in '97,

29:49.720 --> 29:51.120
someone came to the video rental shop

29:51.200 --> 29:52.920
to hire Wolfie to kill someone.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.640
I took note of that person back then.

29:55.920 --> 29:56.880
Why didn't you report it at the time?

29:56.960 --> 29:58.000
Officer,

29:58.520 --> 30:00.000
I'm just an ordinary citizen.

30:00.720 --> 30:02.880
How would I dare
offend people from that world?

30:02.960 --> 30:05.600
Besides, I don't have nine lives.

30:05.680 --> 30:07.280
Cut the nonsense.

30:07.360 --> 30:08.640
Who was that person?

30:10.080 --> 30:12.400
Song Qingsong's brother-in-law,
Wu Shanlong.

30:12.480 --> 30:14.720
I saw him clearly back then.

30:14.800 --> 30:15.960
He was even driving that Mercedes

30:16.040 --> 30:18.040
with the license ending in 688.

30:19.000 --> 30:20.840
-Are you sure?
-I'm sure.

30:20.920 --> 30:23.200
Officer, I'm very good
at remembering faces.

30:23.280 --> 30:26.080
Back then, Jin Manshan
and his subordinate, Hu Anping,

30:26.160 --> 30:28.840
even took me to the entrance of Dahuihuang
to identify him in person.

30:32.080 --> 30:33.200
Officer,

30:33.720 --> 30:35.400
I've told you almost everything.

30:35.480 --> 30:37.000
About my case…

30:37.080 --> 30:39.040
-In this case…
-Han.

30:40.000 --> 30:42.000
-What is it, Officer He?
-Your turn.

30:42.080 --> 30:43.040
Alright.

30:43.120 --> 30:46.160
Officer, does this count
as meritorious service?

30:46.240 --> 30:48.000
-Officer.
-Sit down.

30:51.360 --> 30:53.040
He, let's go to Hongyun Huihuang Club.

30:53.120 --> 30:54.000
Let's go.

30:54.520 --> 30:55.480
Hold on.

30:58.640 --> 31:00.760
-What were those words?
-What does that mean?

31:01.800 --> 31:03.120
You take the lead, I'll back you up.

31:03.200 --> 31:05.480
You go upfront, I stay behind.
You play it clean, I handle the rough.

31:07.480 --> 31:09.000
What kind of coordination is that?

31:09.080 --> 31:10.240
Catching him is what matters.

31:10.320 --> 31:11.280
Let's go.

31:11.360 --> 31:13.320
I really can't believe this.

31:13.920 --> 31:15.400
In broad daylight,

31:15.480 --> 31:19.080
someone actually dares
to assault a law abiding citizen.

31:19.160 --> 31:20.560
And you're still sitting there?

31:20.640 --> 31:22.080
How are you enforcing the law?

31:22.160 --> 31:23.200
Why are you just sitting there?

31:23.280 --> 31:25.080
Go catch him.

31:25.600 --> 31:27.560
Do you have no sense of compassion at all?

31:27.640 --> 31:29.600
Look at this. You won't
even pour me a cup of tea.

31:29.680 --> 31:31.800
Is this how you treat an injured person?

31:34.320 --> 31:35.760
I came here to report a case,

31:36.520 --> 31:40.000
so why does it feel like
I'm the one being interrogated?

31:42.280 --> 31:44.840
You two officers,
aren't you criminal police?

31:44.920 --> 31:46.720
Why are you working at the station?

31:46.800 --> 31:47.640
Wu Shanlong,

31:47.720 --> 31:49.480
you should know very well

31:49.560 --> 31:51.000
why we're here.

31:51.800 --> 31:53.200
I don't know. How would I know?

31:53.280 --> 31:54.560
You don't know?

31:54.640 --> 31:55.680
Fine.

31:55.760 --> 31:57.440
Start by explaining
what happened to your head.

31:58.720 --> 32:00.480
Someone tried to harm me.

32:00.560 --> 32:01.560
In broad daylight,

32:01.640 --> 32:03.880
he tried to smash my head open.

32:05.880 --> 32:08.040
Who tried to harm you? Tell it in detail.

32:08.120 --> 32:09.600
After we met yesterday,

32:09.680 --> 32:11.280
I was about to drive home.

32:11.360 --> 32:14.360
I don't know who put
a stone under my tire.

32:14.440 --> 32:15.920
So I got out, and when
I was moving that stone,

32:16.000 --> 32:18.160
suddenly, someone appeared behind me,

32:18.240 --> 32:19.440
and then bang,

32:21.360 --> 32:22.760
hit the back of my head.

32:22.840 --> 32:24.440
Luckily, I've trained
in martial arts before.

32:24.520 --> 32:25.360
My reflexes were fast.

32:25.440 --> 32:28.640
Otherwise, my head
would've been split in two.

32:28.720 --> 32:30.200
Was there anyone else at the scene?

32:31.960 --> 32:33.120
I left through the back door.

32:33.840 --> 32:35.120
No one saw anything.

32:38.440 --> 32:40.040
This is the weapon
the attacker left behind.

32:40.120 --> 32:41.360
Take it and run tests.

32:41.440 --> 32:43.600
The attacker's fingerprints must be on it.

32:44.200 --> 32:46.240
Right now, it's all
your fingerprints on it.

32:53.680 --> 32:55.600
Who do you think attacked you?

32:56.120 --> 32:57.360
I don't know who it was.

32:57.440 --> 32:58.720
Maybe someone saw
I was driving a Mercedes,

32:58.800 --> 33:01.440
thought I had money, and tried to rob me.

33:01.520 --> 33:04.440
After knocking me out,
they realized I was broke.

33:07.680 --> 33:09.040
Don't worry,

33:09.120 --> 33:10.840
we'll take this seriously.

33:10.920 --> 33:12.720
Do you have anything else to add?

33:16.000 --> 33:17.200
No.

33:23.960 --> 33:25.680
Then that's all.

33:25.760 --> 33:27.000
I can leave now, right?

33:27.080 --> 33:29.520
Who said you could leave?
We still have more questions.

33:29.600 --> 33:32.520
Repeat what you said yesterday
at Hongyun Huihuang Club.

33:32.600 --> 33:34.080
Didn't I already say it yesterday?

33:34.160 --> 33:35.760
-It's only been a day…
-Cut the nonsense.

33:35.840 --> 33:37.000
Say it.

33:40.440 --> 33:42.840
A few years ago,
Song Qingsong gave me 40,000

33:42.920 --> 33:44.640
to get rid of Xu Meng and her father.

33:44.720 --> 33:47.080
He may not know the law, but I do.
I couldn't possibly do what he asked…

33:47.160 --> 33:48.960
What you said doesn't match
your earlier statement.

33:53.280 --> 33:54.160
It's the same.

33:54.240 --> 33:55.560
There's no difference. It's the same.

33:56.440 --> 33:58.240
Song Qingsong, 40,000,

33:58.320 --> 33:59.960
Xu Meng and her father. I didn't do it.

34:00.040 --> 34:01.160
Then…

34:01.920 --> 34:03.240
Wu Shanlong,

34:03.760 --> 34:07.320
someone reported that you hired Wolfie
to kill Xu Meng and her father.

34:07.920 --> 34:09.440
Who said that? Who said it?

34:09.520 --> 34:10.560
That's slander.

34:10.639 --> 34:11.400
A false accusation.
This is clearly a frame up…

34:11.480 --> 34:12.800
Wu Shanlong.

34:13.480 --> 34:15.840
According to the Criminal Law
of the People's Republic of China,

34:15.920 --> 34:17.520
Articles 25 and 29,

34:17.600 --> 34:19.600
hiring someone to kill is punished

34:19.679 --> 34:21.400
as joint intentional homicide.

34:21.480 --> 34:23.679
The person who hires
is considered an instigator

34:23.760 --> 34:25.440
and bears primary criminal responsibility.

34:25.520 --> 34:27.719
That's impossible.
Someone must be framing me.

34:27.800 --> 34:29.280
-Impossible.
-Think carefully.

34:29.800 --> 34:32.400
Will you confess for leniency
or resist and face harsher punishment?

34:40.280 --> 34:41.159
Confess.

34:42.159 --> 34:43.320
I'll confess.

34:44.360 --> 34:46.080
I did hire Wolfie.

34:46.159 --> 34:47.880
Song Qingsong instructed

34:47.960 --> 34:50.280
that Xu Meng and her father
be driven out of Weiyang.

34:50.360 --> 34:52.199
I only meant to scare them away.

34:52.280 --> 34:53.960
I never intended to kill anyone.

34:54.040 --> 34:56.280
Besides, Wolfie never acted.

34:56.360 --> 34:57.880
-So…
-If Wolfie didn't act,

34:57.960 --> 34:59.520
then how did Xu Meng and her father die?

34:59.600 --> 35:01.600
-Did you hire someone else?
-No.

35:01.680 --> 35:03.640
-Or did you do it yourself?
-How could that be?

35:03.720 --> 35:05.600
It has nothing to do with me.
I didn't do anything.

35:06.600 --> 35:08.080
Stop playing tricks.

35:10.200 --> 35:11.640
I don't know anything anymore.

35:11.720 --> 35:13.800
I don't know anything now.
Go ask Song Qingsong.

35:13.880 --> 35:14.920
I don't know anything. Ask Song Qingsong.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.240
I want to go home now.

35:19.160 --> 35:20.920
Playing dumb,

35:21.000 --> 35:22.440
digging in his heels.

35:22.960 --> 35:25.600
He's definitely still hiding something.

35:25.680 --> 35:27.720
Since Wu Zhengxiong has pointed to him,

35:27.800 --> 35:30.360
then let's just detain him for 48 hours,

35:30.440 --> 35:32.400
wear him down, then press him again.

35:32.480 --> 35:33.760
He,

35:33.840 --> 35:36.400
Wu Shanlong came in as a reporting victim.

35:36.480 --> 35:38.240
We have no direct evidence

35:38.320 --> 35:39.480
and no detention warrant.

35:39.560 --> 35:41.720
If he keeps making a scene,

35:41.800 --> 35:43.200
we'll only end up more passive.

35:43.280 --> 35:45.160
Wait here. I'll go back
to the bureau and get one issued.

35:45.240 --> 35:46.400
Hold on.

35:47.240 --> 35:48.280
Let him go first.

35:48.360 --> 35:49.800
See what he does.

35:49.880 --> 35:52.360
If there really are accomplices
or anything hidden,

35:52.440 --> 35:54.480
once he's out, he'll make a move.

35:57.720 --> 35:58.920
I'm just angry.

35:59.440 --> 36:01.360
This guy has played us so many times,

36:01.440 --> 36:04.680
and now he's still out there living it up,

36:04.760 --> 36:06.480
free for five whole years.

36:07.960 --> 36:09.760
That's exactly why those
five years have cost us so much.

36:09.840 --> 36:11.320
Many clues and evidence

36:11.400 --> 36:12.840
are now hard to track down.

36:12.920 --> 36:15.200
We might as well let him show his hand,

36:15.280 --> 36:16.760
then use that chance to break through.

36:17.360 --> 36:19.400
Don't worry. I'll keep an eye on him.

36:20.600 --> 36:21.640
Then we cover both ends.

36:21.720 --> 36:23.080
I'll go find Jin Manshan

36:23.160 --> 36:25.040
and see if I can get anything out of him.

36:26.520 --> 36:28.720
Jin Manshan got involved
in organized crime three years ago

36:28.800 --> 36:29.840
and fled.

36:31.560 --> 36:33.080
The big one may run,

36:33.160 --> 36:34.120
but the small one won't.

36:39.840 --> 36:42.600
PUBLIC SECURITY

37:03.040 --> 37:04.280
Let's go to Yuanlongli.

37:26.520 --> 37:30.400
SWISH!

37:31.560 --> 37:33.040
BANG!

37:38.480 --> 37:39.640
Take a break.

37:40.160 --> 37:41.680
Eat while it's hot.

37:43.640 --> 37:44.600
I'll eat later.

37:44.680 --> 37:46.200
What do you mean later?

37:46.280 --> 37:48.680
By the time you remember,
I'll have cooked the next meal.

37:48.760 --> 37:49.760
I'm watching you.

37:49.840 --> 37:51.160
Eat it now.

38:01.040 --> 38:02.080
By the way,

38:02.600 --> 38:04.320
did that kid say anything today?

38:07.520 --> 38:08.760
He's developed acute stress.

38:08.840 --> 38:10.320
He hasn't said a word,

38:10.400 --> 38:11.720
completely shut himself off.

38:13.880 --> 38:14.800
Right now,

38:14.880 --> 38:17.360
I'm reading the comics he used to read,
trying to find a breakthrough.

38:18.240 --> 38:20.800
His mother said he usually just reads,

38:20.880 --> 38:22.080
doesn't play games or hang out online.

38:22.160 --> 38:23.920
I just can't figure out

38:24.000 --> 38:26.520
why he skipped school
and went to Yuanlongli.

38:26.600 --> 38:28.400
Times change.

38:28.480 --> 38:29.840
Energy is limited.

38:30.360 --> 38:32.040
Focus on the important.
Let go of the trivial.

38:32.120 --> 38:33.880
Food and clothing come first.

38:34.920 --> 38:35.920
What does that mean?

38:36.000 --> 38:38.680
It means when you investigate,

38:38.760 --> 38:40.400
you have to rely on common sense.

38:40.480 --> 38:42.640
What Han Zi'ang's mother said

38:42.720 --> 38:44.680
can't be taken at face value.

38:44.760 --> 38:47.000
That doesn't mean
she's lying to the police,

38:47.640 --> 38:50.160
but how many parents nowadays

38:50.240 --> 38:52.640
truly understand their children?

38:53.240 --> 38:55.640
Especially teenagers.

38:56.600 --> 38:57.840
Just like back then,

38:57.920 --> 38:59.040
you didn't understand me either.

39:00.480 --> 39:01.600
So,

39:01.680 --> 39:05.880
what Han Zi'ang's mother sees
may just be the side

39:05.960 --> 39:08.680
he wants her to see.

39:08.760 --> 39:10.880
Maybe Han Zi'ang

39:10.960 --> 39:13.280
does like gaming and hanging out online.

39:15.560 --> 39:16.400
That makes sense.

39:16.480 --> 39:18.520
At his age,

39:18.600 --> 39:20.160
legal internet cafes won't admit him.

39:20.240 --> 39:21.440
He can only go to unlicensed ones.

39:22.240 --> 39:25.240
But there aren't any in Yuanlongli.

39:25.320 --> 39:27.280
If you can find them,

39:28.280 --> 39:30.120
they wouldn't be unlicensed, would they?

39:33.640 --> 39:36.640
LASER ENGRAVING. CUSTOM GIFTS

39:46.320 --> 39:50.360
JUAN JUAN SHOE SHOP

39:50.440 --> 39:52.120
LIANG'S COMPUTER SUPPLIES

39:52.200 --> 39:53.040
Miss.

39:53.640 --> 39:54.720
Where's your boss?

39:55.640 --> 39:57.520
He stepped out.

39:57.600 --> 40:00.080
I've already asked this shop before.
No useful leads.

40:00.160 --> 40:01.240
Let's hurry and check the internet cafes.

40:06.960 --> 40:08.760
-Dad.
-Sir.

40:24.240 --> 40:25.640
Heal him.

40:27.480 --> 40:29.400
Druid, you can't heal?

40:31.440 --> 40:33.680
Uncle He, you scared me.

40:33.760 --> 40:35.640
At least say something first.

40:35.720 --> 40:36.800
You're the owner here, right?

40:38.640 --> 40:40.120
Why are you running
an illegal internet cafe

40:40.200 --> 40:41.600
and letting minors play games?

40:42.200 --> 40:43.520
Officer?

40:43.600 --> 40:44.640
Officer, you've misunderstood.

40:44.720 --> 40:45.840
I'm not running an illegal place.

40:45.920 --> 40:47.160
I have a license. A license?

40:47.240 --> 40:50.280
I just can't stand seeing kids
having nowhere to play.

40:50.360 --> 40:51.400
That's why I let them in.

40:51.480 --> 40:53.200
What I'm doing
is basically a public service.

40:53.280 --> 40:54.240
I don't charge anything.

40:54.320 --> 40:56.840
Really. I can swear on my game logs.

41:00.120 --> 41:02.440
Alright, don't make things hard for Du.

41:02.520 --> 41:05.600
He's an old acquaintance
of both me and your Uncle Ran.

41:05.680 --> 41:06.560
Really.

41:10.600 --> 41:11.520
Let me ask you again.

41:11.600 --> 41:13.000
Have you seen this kid?

41:15.400 --> 41:17.320
I already told you earlier,

41:17.400 --> 41:18.600
I haven't seen him.

41:20.080 --> 41:21.880
You can go ask outside.

41:26.640 --> 41:28.520
-Uncle He, your daughter
-Hey, boy.

41:28.600 --> 41:29.840
-is fierce.
-Excuse me.

41:29.920 --> 41:31.000
Have you seen this kid before?

41:31.080 --> 41:32.680
Takes after her dad.

41:32.760 --> 41:34.640
Born to be a criminal investigator.

41:35.240 --> 41:36.360
That's right.

41:36.440 --> 41:38.600
Hey, excuse me.

41:38.680 --> 41:39.800
Have you seen this kid?

41:39.880 --> 41:41.080
No.

41:42.360 --> 41:44.320
Hi. Have you seen this kid?

41:44.920 --> 41:45.960
No.

41:47.880 --> 41:49.000
Wait.

41:51.200 --> 41:52.680
I've seen him.

41:52.760 --> 41:55.960
Last week, he was at that computer
watching role playing stuff,

41:56.040 --> 41:57.160
laughing while watching,

41:57.240 --> 41:59.040
even speaking some Japanese.

